•
To draft paid performance proposals and presentations.&nbsp;

•
Manage all digital platforms relationship for accounts under management. &nbsp;

•
Develop and manage all components of a paid performance campaigns, including campaign setup, optimization, reporting and tracking.&nbsp;

•
Work closely in sharing and implementing digital performance best practices and beta with clients and work closely with different platforms on developing the partnership.&nbsp;

•
Ensure delivery on performance targets for clients.&nbsp;

•
Monitor &amp; measure performance activity, engagement metrics, analyzing results, translating information into learning &amp; strategic recommendations. &nbsp;

•
Maintain appropriate high-level Client relationships. &nbsp;

•
Build Client respect and be recognized as a leader on their business. &nbsp;

•
Work closely with Account Managers to identify and deliver performance marketing requirements. &nbsp;

•
Work closely with account lead to deliver on the long-term strategies. &nbsp;

•
Work closely with other business units within the organization.&nbsp;

&nbsp; &nbsp;

Skills and Experience

•
4-5 years Digital all-rounder with proven experience and a strong understanding of multiple digital media channels as well as a passionate following of new/emerging channels &amp; technologies.&nbsp;

•
Google Ads and other social platforms like Facebook, Snapchat, TikTok and&nbsp;X&nbsp;ads are essential for this role.&nbsp;

•
Expert in MMPs with 2+ years of experience in app development and user acquisition&nbsp;

•
Proficient in integrating platforms and tech implementations, including pixels, SDKs, and CAPI.&nbsp;

•
Familiar with CDPs&nbsp;

•
Strong presentation skills and client management experience&nbsp;is&nbsp;required.&nbsp;

•
Data-driven and creative to push the envelope on new user acquisition.&nbsp;

